Storage architecture:
--------------------
      storage = disks
      control file  - stores physical structure informationof the database.
      Data files - stores data (tables, procedures application data)
      Online redo log file - Stores redo log entries
      Archived redo log files - copy of online redo log files
      Backup files  - Stores exact copy of data fies for recovery
      Parameter files - Stores the configuration data of the database instance
      Password file - Stores the passwrods of the admin users (sysdba, sysoper, sysasm)
      Alert log - Stores log massages and errors occured in the database
      trace files - error trace info of process
      
